    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable without an internet connection.<br>Connection required only if you want to submit your TopDogScore to the global ranking. (Anonymous connection with a nickname, no registration required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the art of reflexes and mental math</strong> in worlds with multiple challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 10 magical chest beaches with their infernal coconuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the 5 increasing levels to reach the &quot;Sharks&quot; level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect seashells, earn costumes, catch the final diamond, gather the fisherman's fish to fill your aquarium, and stock up on coconut milk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deserts of the Pollugon people with their enchanting clouds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the &quot;Legend&quot; level across 6 clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Pollugon creatures, earn &quot;Quick Shots&quot; points, and meet the enigmatic Algebronco.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fantastic forests with enchanted bubbles and mushrooms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 10 forests with progressive levels. Face Pollumath in the final mushroom. Earn costumes, fill your treasure chest with gold coins and gems. Attempt &quot;perfect&quot; runs and score &quot;combo&quot; points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the hero or heroine who will restore order in each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your focus, develop your composure, and become unshakable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic save feature and a 1v1 local mode on the same device available for even more fun!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable without an internet connection.<br>Connection required only if you want to submit your TopDogScore to the global ranking. (Anonymous connection with a nickname, no registration required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the art of reflexes and mental math</strong> in worlds with multiple challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 10 magical chest beaches with their infernal coconuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the 5 increasing levels to reach the &quot;Sharks&quot; level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect seashells, earn costumes, catch the final diamond, gather the fisherman's fish to fill your aquarium, and stock up on coconut milk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deserts of the Pollugon people with their enchanting clouds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the &quot;Legend&quot; level across 6 clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Pollugon creatures, earn &quot;Quick Shots&quot; points, and meet the enigmatic Algebronco.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fantastic forests with enchanted bubbles and mushrooms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 10 forests with progressive levels. Face Pollumath in the final mushroom. Earn costumes, fill your treasure chest with gold coins and gems. Attempt &quot;perfect&quot; runs and score &quot;combo&quot; points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the hero or heroine who will restore order in each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your focus, develop your composure, and become unshakable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic save feature and a 1v1 local mode on the same device available for even more fun!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Master the art of reflexes and mental math in a real action-adventure game. Explore magical worlds and uncover all their secrets, creatures, and treasures. Take on every challenge and, if you wish, compete in the global ranking. (7-120 years old)",
